WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.361
(gentle upbeat music)

00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:09.361
♪ There was a boy ♪

00:00:10.453 --> 00:00:15.453
♪ A very strange, enchanted boy ♪

00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:23.558
♪ They say he wandered very far ♪

00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:29.550
♪ Very far ♪

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.550
♪ Over land and sea ♪

00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:43.351
♪ A little shy ♪

00:00:43.351 --> 00:00:48.351
♪ And sad of eye ♪

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:53.647
♪ But very wise was he ♪

00:00:56.005 --> 00:01:01.005
♪ And then one day ♪

00:01:01.951 --> 00:01:06.951
♪ One magic day, he passed my way ♪

00:01:10.121 --> 00:01:15.121
♪ And while we spoke of many things ♪

00:01:16.428 --> 00:01:21.223
♪ Fools and kings ♪

00:01:21.223 --> 00:01:26.223
♪ This he said to me ♪

00:01:31.215 --> 00:01:36.215
♪ The greatest thing you'll ever learn ♪

00:01:40.606 --> 00:01:45.606
♪ Is just to love ♪

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:50.527
♪ And be loved in return ♪

00:02:03.802 --> 00:02:06.802
(audience cheering)

